L0246: Tracked evidence invalidated by mutation

This evidence is tied to the current generation of a mutable binding. A write changed the generation and the required proof was not re-established before use or a control-flow edge. Refresh the tracked proof after the write; an ordinary snapshot proof still describes its historical value.

Example from `tests/corpus/reject/tracked_loop_edges.lc`; the full file is a regression test.

```locus
if n == 10 {
            break;
        } else {
        }
        let (m, still) = advance(n, ok);
        n = m;
        if n == 5 {
            continue;
        } else {
        }
```

Language, as built: [1.12:3](../../atlas.html#/doc/language/spec-1.12:3).
